'''''Orobanche mutelii''''', the '''dwarf broomrape''', is a species of plant in family [[Orobanchaceae]]. It is endemic to [[Malta]].<ref>{{Cite web|title=Orobanche muteli - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/50958524|access-date=2021-12-24|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=Dwarf broomrape {{!}} Mahmiyat.ps|url=https://www.mahmiyat.ps/en/floraAndFauna/848|access-date=2021-12-24|website=www.mahmiyat.ps|language=en}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=Orobanche muteli in Global Plants on JSTOR|url=https://plants.jstor.org/compilation/Orobanche.muteli|access-date=2021-12-24|website=plants.jstor.org}}</ref>
